{% comment %}
  Cartel offer tab — the fixed right-edge "GET 10% OFF" tab (lane 7C).
  Rendered on every page from theme.liquid. Clicking it opens the email
  popup (cartel-email-popup.liquid) via cartel-conversion.js — including
  after the popup was dismissed. z-index 140: below the popup overlay (150)
  and the cart drawer (1000). Skin: assets/cartel-conversion.css.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="cl cl-fixed">
  <button
    type="button"
    id="cl-offtab"
    class="offtab"
    aria-haspopup="dialog"
    aria-controls="cl-popup"
    aria-label="Get 10% off your first order"
  >
    Get 10% off
  </button>
</div>
